Third-party material
--------------------

ModelArtifacts/tokenizer/vocab.txt and tokenizer_config.json
  The WordPiece vocabulary and tokenizer settings of the base model
  sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2 (derived from the BERT uncased
  vocabulary). That model is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:
  https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0
  The files are included as exported by the Veto project from that model,
  solely so the Swift tokenizer can reproduce the base model's tokenization.

Trained Veto models are not included
------------------------------------

This repository does not contain, and does not distribute, a trained Veto
classifier. A Veto model is trained on its owner's private text messages and
is deliberately kept out of version control and out of releases. Each user
trains their own model with the separate `veto` project and imports it
locally. The Core ML model that the app embeds when you build it is a
derivative of the Apache-2.0 base model above plus your own training data;
you are responsible for how you share any build that contains it.
